  "prefLabel": "Agr 207.01 Document Retention",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 207.01 Document Retention. All written decisions or orders pursuant to RSA 541-A:35, shall be retained by the department for a period of 2 years or as set by the director of the division of archives and records management, which ever is greater.\n\nSource. #8309-A, eff 3-24-05",
